## **🧠 Decision Matrix: Which Tool When?**

### **"I want to understand what's in this Python file"**
```
0th: mcp_nuanced_initialize_graph(repo_path, project_root)          # REQUIRED FIRST STEP
1st: mcp_nuanced_list_file_definitions(file_path)         # Get structured overview (relative to project_root)
2nd: mcp_nuanced_get_function_source(...)                 # Dive into specific functions
❌ AVOID: read_file() for exploration
```

### **"I need to see a specific function's code"**
```
0th: mcp_nuanced_initialize_graph(repo_path, project_root)          # REQUIRED FIRST STEP
✅ USE: mcp_nuanced_get_function_source(file_path, function_name)  # file_path relative to project_root
❌ AVOID: read_file() and manual searching
```

### **"I want to modify this function"**
```
0th: mcp_nuanced_initialize_graph(repo_path, project_root)                     # REQUIRED FIRST STEP
1st: mcp_nuanced_analyze_change_impact(file_path, function_name)      # Safety check (file_path relative to project_root)
2nd: mcp_nuanced_get_function_call_graph(...)                        # Understand dependencies  
3rd: mcp_nuanced_analyze_function_imports(...)                       # Check imports needed
Then: Make informed changes
```

### **"I need to move/reorganize functions"**
```
0th: mcp_nuanced_initialize_graph(repo_path, project_root)                  # REQUIRED FIRST STEP
1st: mcp_nuanced_preview_function_move(...)                       # Plan the move (paths relative to project_root)
2nd: mcp_nuanced_move_function(..., dry_run=True)                 # Dry run
3rd: mcp_nuanced_move_function(..., dry_run=False)                # Execute move
```

### **"I'm exploring a new codebase"**
```
1st: mcp_nuanced_initialize_graph(repo_path, project_root)
2nd: mcp_nuanced_list_file_definitions(key_files)     # Survey main files
3rd: mcp_nuanced_analyze_dependencies(main_modules)   # Understand architecture
