```

### **"I need to analyze specific code sections"**
```
0th: mcp_nuanced_initialize_graph(repo_path, project_root)          # REQUIRED FIRST STEP
1st: mcp_nuanced_get_code_by_lines(file_path, line_ranges) # Extract specific lines
2nd: mcp_nuanced_get_function_source(...)                 # Analyze specific functions
3rd: mcp_nuanced_analyze_function_imports(...)            # Check dependencies
```

